# Maintaining docs/theory/

> High-level principles: `dev-notes/design/agent_instructions_design.md`

`docs/theory/` holds MyST notes for the distributions and algorithms.
The source is Shi2016.
`gig.md`, `gh.md`, and `varentropy.md` state the library contract.
Link each derivation to the matching page on
<https://xshi19.github.io/math/normix-theory/>.
Leave every other theory page as a derivation.

